      "translatedText": "| Direction | Data | Actual code purpose |\n|---|---|---|\n| Read file | `prior_pcd_file` | Load PCD, transform at startup, downsample, build fixed target map |\n| Subscribe | `registered_scan`，renamable by input_cloud_topic | Copy XYZ coordinates and accumulate multiple frames as the matching point cloud for this round; do not use reflection intensity or per\\-point time |\n| Subscribe | `initialpose`，PoseWithCovarianceStamped | Reset the initial matching value using a manually given pose; the topic name is hardcoded as a relative name |\n| Broadcast | `map → odom` | Publish the reference frame correction obtained from point cloud matching; do not publish independent pose or matching point cloud topics |",
